#. Description of the plugin
#: abono.php
msgid ""
"Add a newsletter opt-in at checkout and collect subscribers with consent."
msgstr ""
"Añade una suscripción al boletín al finalizar la compra y recopila "
"suscriptores con su consentimiento."

#. Author of the plugin
#: abono.php
msgid "WPPoland.com"
msgstr "WPPoland.com"

